NOTE on training material:

This project ships:
- Source code under MIT (the LICENSE above).
- LaTeX template snippets under their original third-party licenses (see
  07_paper/template_raw/).
- No competition problem statements, datasets, or excellent-paper PDFs.

When you import a problem via `agentctl.py import-problem` or place PDFs in
02_references/excellent_papers/, those files remain under the copyright of
their original authors / CUMCM committee and are NOT covered by this MIT
license. The .gitignore is configured so that imported problem material is
excluded by default; do not commit those files when you publish a fork.
